<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Group sets 80 trln won sales goal.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Group sets 80 trln won sales goal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hyundai Group, South Korea's largest conglomerate in terms of assets, said on Tuesday it had set at 80 trillion won the target for this year's sales by its member firms, up from an estimated 70 trillion won in 1996.</p>
<p>A Hyundai statement said it targeted raising exports by its 50 member firms, that include carmaker Hyundai Motor Co and chipmaker Hyundai Electronics Industries Co, to $17.3 billion from $15.2 billion in 1996.</p>
</text>
